&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td colspan="2" style="vertical-align:middle;border-top-style:solid;border-top-width:0.75pt;border-top-color:#000000;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.75pt;border-bottom-color:#000000;overflow:hidden;" valign="middle"&gt;&lt;p class="smt_tblC" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;前連結会計年度&lt;br/&gt;（&lt;span&gt;令和４年７月31日&lt;/span&gt;）&lt;/p&gt;
